[[576,8,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               controls the compressor\nengagement circuit.</p><p>The relay receives a supply from the line\ncontrolled by the ignition (INT/A) for the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               protected\nby fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : both are housed in the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The coil receives a supply controlled by\nthe ignition (15/54) from the line from fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              of the additional\nfuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ; the relay is thus energized by an earth signal\ncoming from the engine management control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : in this\nway the air conditioning compressor engagement electro-magnet \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\noperated through a voltage of 12 V.</p><p>Climate control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ( pin 7\nof connector A) sends a compressor enablement signal to four-stage\npressure switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . If circuit pressures are correct, the\nsignal leaves the pressure switch and reaches engine control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .\n(pin 3 of connector B).</p><p>According to its own internal control logic,\nthe control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends the command to engage the compressor\n(from pin 32  of connector D) which energizes the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]